This license covers the original code and text in this repository only (app/,
static/ outside static/vendor/ and static/audio/, tests/, tests_js/, main.py and
the docs). It does NOT cover:

- third-party libraries and fonts in static/vendor/ (p5.js LGPL-2.1, p5.brush MIT,
  jsQR Apache-2.0, Permanent Marker Apache-2.0, Fredoka OFL-1.1), each under its
  own license, listed in static/vendor/VENDOR.md;
- static/js/art/engine.js, an adapted port of ClaudeAnimationBase
  (https://github.com/JohnHeibel/ClaudeAnimationBase), MIT, (c) 2026 John Heibel,
  license in static/vendor/claude-animation-base/LICENSE;
- the Mixkit sound effects and ambiences (Mixkit Sound Effects Free License). They
  are NOT included in this repository: tools/fetch_audio.py downloads them from
  Mixkit into static/audio/sfx/ and static/audio/ambience/ (list and sha256 in
  static/audio/mixkit.json);
- the tracks by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com) in static/audio/music/, under
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0;
- the six songs generated with Suno (music/*.mp3 and the matching files in
  static/audio/music/), subject to Suno's terms of service.

Sources and attributions for every audio file: static/audio/CREDITS.md.

The "Italian brainrot" characters are internet memes; this is a fan project with no
affiliation to their creators, to the Backrooms or to the SCP Wiki.
